SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This MIT licence covers the material authored in this repository: the four
original games in games/ (Vaultbreak, Tessera, Ember Drift, Rift Nine), the
Arcade Shell in shell/, the local library server in server/, and the tooling in
tests/ and tools/.

It does NOT cover the six port titles. Those remain under their upstream
licences:

  Mindustry                  GPL-3.0      https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry
  Shattered Pixel Dungeon    GPL-3.0      https://github.com/00-Evan/shattered-pixel-dungeon
  Luanti                     LGPL-2.1+    https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti
  Endless Sky                GPL-3.0      https://github.com/endless-sky/endless-sky
  DarkPlaces                 GPL-2.0      https://github.com/evilant0/DarkPlaces
  DDNet                      Zlib         https://github.com/ddnet/ddnet

None of their source is vendored in this repository. Each ports/<id>/PROVENANCE.md
records the upstream URL, pinned commit, licence, artifact size and SHA-256. Reusing
a port means going to upstream and accepting upstream's terms.
